nup contract; compare pinned runtime adapters in scratch; design one end-to-end pilot (genericapp plus room coding) demonstrating interrupted provisioning/restart/browser-off operation, competing agents, same request recovery, held budgets, exact-base forks, drain/dispose with retained evidence. Research/fixtures aren't deployed runtime proof. No code, tests, installs, provider operations or builder priorities changed; no implementation commissioned."}